              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Filed by: Karvansara core - the open door, stage KS3, session 17 on 2026-08-15 01:01:49.\nSeverity: medium.\nCloses with: conductor bug fix 43 \u2014 the alert resolves itself at the next upload, because a fixed bug stops being rendered and code scanning closes what a later analysis no longer reports."
